<BaseLayout title="Building Software with AI | Preston Wallace" description="Guest lecture for CSC 3100: Software Engineering: AI-assisted development, fundamentals, verification, and the future of software work." noindex>
  <nav class="deck-controls" aria-label="Presentation controls">
